      <title>iOS 27 iPhone 接力功能：两部手机共用同一号码已可在模拟器切换</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260902/iOS-27-iPhone-%E6%8E%A5%E5%8A%9B%E5%8A%9F%E8%83%BD%E4%B8%A4%E9%83%A8%E6%89%8B%E6%9C%BA%E5%85%B1%E7%94%A8%E5%90%8C%E4%B8%80%E5%8F%B7%E7%A0%81%E5%B7%B2%E5%8F%AF%E5%9C%A8%E6%A8%A1%E6%8B%9F%E5%99%A8%E5%88%87%E6%8D%A2/</link>
